@Host = http://localhost:5217

### Comprehensive Health Check (JSON report with Redis & SQL Server latency)
GET {{Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness Probe
GET {{Host}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Liveness Probe
GET {{Host}}/health/live

### Live Server Telemetry (Active SignalR Connections, Placements, Uptime)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/telemetry
Accept: application/json

### Active Color Palette (32 Curated Painting Colors)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/palette?activeOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### Full 256-Color Palette
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/palette
Accept: application/json

### Minimap 160x160 Binary Overview Buffer (25.6 KB)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/minimap

### Active Territory Reservations
GET {{Host}}/api/reservations/active
Accept: application/json

### Public Canvas Wall Studios Directory
GET {{Host}}/api/walls
Accept: application/json
